        "answer": "Builds killer card presentation and binds entire element model to calling card. Nonnil Attacker xuid/clientNum/rank/rankIcon callbacks update emblem, name, cleaned clan, max-rank-localized rank text and icon. Nil updates do not clear old fields. Hidden predicate AlwaysFalse; CustomGames delegates IsWZCustomGame. Registers close, optional postload, returns self. It displays supplied identity without establishing who killed whom, rank truth or backend provenance.",
